<title>USA: Property Capital sets special $0.20/shr div.</title>
<headline>Property Capital sets special $0.20/shr div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property Capitol Trust on Friday said it declared a special dividend of $0.20 a share, along with its regular dividend of $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>Both dividends are payable on May 23 to shareholders of record on May 12.  </p>
<p>The special dividend represents a portion of proceeds of prior sales which had not previously been distributed, the company said.</p>
